    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833,
    "dDurationMs": 1087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Welcome to the Huberman Lab Podcast,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920,
    "dDurationMs": 1287,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where we discuss science"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3207,
    "dDurationMs": 2756,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and science-based tools for everyday life."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9360,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm Andrew Huberman,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10350,
    "dDurationMs": 2449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm a Professor of\nNeurobiology and Ophthalmology"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12799,
    "dDurationMs": 1992,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at Stanford School of Medicine."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14791,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, we're talking all about fasting."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17552,
    "dDurationMs": 2718,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And anytime we're talking about fasting,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20270,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we are also talking about eating,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22070,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we all need to\neat sooner or later."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24740,
    "dDurationMs": 1298,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going to talk about how fasting"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26038,
    "dDurationMs": 3178,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when we eat influences"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29216,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a large range of aspects"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31343,
    "dDurationMs": 4247,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of our health and wellbeing,\nboth physical and mental."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35590,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, well, nowadays,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36760,
    "dDurationMs": 3563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most people are familiar with\nthe term intermittent fasting,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40323,
    "dDurationMs": 3328,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also sometimes called\ntime-restricted feeding."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43651,
    "dDurationMs": 2431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think most people\ndon't really understand"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46082,
    "dDurationMs": 1686,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how that process works."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47768,
    "dDurationMs": 2682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's sort of obvious that\nintermittent fasting,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50450,
    "dDurationMs": 1948,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "aka time-restricted feeding,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52398,
    "dDurationMs": 3952,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "involves eating at certain\nperiods of each 24-hour cycle,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56350,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or maybe even not eating for\nentire days, in some cases."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59812,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, if you think about it,\neverybody sleeps eventually."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63345,
    "dDurationMs": 4236,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And therefore, because people\ndon't eat during their sleep,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67581,
    "dDurationMs": 3059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost everybody is employing some form"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70640,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of intermittent fasting or\ntime-restricted feeding."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73930,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we're going to talk about today"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75420,
    "dDurationMs": 3964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is how particular schedules\nof time restricted feeding"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79384,
    "dDurationMs": 2956,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can impact our health in different ways."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82340,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when I say different ways, I mean,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84160,
    "dDurationMs": 2668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're going to talk about\nhow intermittent fasting,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86828,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "aka time-restricted feeding,\nimpacts weight loss,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90588,
    "dDurationMs": 1729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fat loss in particular,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92317,
    "dDurationMs": 4313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "muscle maintenance, and\nloss and gain, organ health,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96630,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such as gut health and\nliver health, the genome,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100200,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the epigenome, inflammation,\nsickness, recovery,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105260,
    "dDurationMs": 3610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and healing from sickness,\nexercise, cognition,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108870,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mood, and lifespan."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110910,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're going to cover a\ntremendous amount of information."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113420,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I promise to make it\nall directly accessible,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116390,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "regardless of whether or not you have"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117740,
    "dDurationMs": 4286,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a background in biology and\nmetabolic science or not."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122026,
    "dDurationMs": 2684,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm also going to talk\nabout a lot of tools."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124710,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, I'm going to discuss"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126360,
    "dDurationMs": 2091,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a number of tools during today's episode"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128451,
    "dDurationMs": 1728,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that actually make it such"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130179,
    "dDurationMs": 3809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you don't have to\nfollow any feeding schedule,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133988,
    "dDurationMs": 2562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or fasting schedule, same thing"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136550,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you think about it,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137890,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in any absolutely strict regimented way,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142056,
    "dDurationMs": 4324,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning if you were to only\neat during an eight hour period"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146380,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of each day, most of the time,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147860,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then occasionally eat\nacross a 12 hour period"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150210,
    "dDurationMs": 1039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the day,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151249,
    "dDurationMs": 3451,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in theory, that could\nactually have pretty serious"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154700,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "detrimental health effects."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156260,
    "dDurationMs": 1445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yet, there are things that you can do"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157705,
    "dDurationMs": 2605,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to attenuate those negative effects."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160310,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161143,
    "dDurationMs": 1672,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are things that\nyou can do and or take"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162815,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can make it as if\nyou did not eat at all."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166235,
    "dDurationMs": 2089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we'll discuss what those tools are."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168324,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in many cases, for sake\nof health, weight loss,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171660,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and performance,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172520,
    "dDurationMs": 3075,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making the body think that\nit did not eat at all can"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175595,
    "dDurationMs": 1874,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually be quite beneficial."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177469,
    "dDurationMs": 1694,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today, we're going to cover mechanism"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179163,
    "dDurationMs": 1887,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're going to cover tools."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181050,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before we do that,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182140,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to highlight a particular\nresult that was published"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184820,
    "dDurationMs": 2263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "recently, because it\nserves as a useful backbone"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187083,
    "dDurationMs": 3359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as we wade into the\nconversation about fasting."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190442,
    "dDurationMs": 2488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a study that was published"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192930,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the journal Cell Metabolism:\nA Cell Press Journal,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195880,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "excellent journal."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197160,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the title of the paper\nis \"Fasting Blood Glucose"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200900,
    "dDurationMs": 3577,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a Predictor of Mortality:\nLost in Translation\"."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204477,
    "dDurationMs": 2263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'll explain what\nthe \"Lost in Translation\""
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206740,
    "dDurationMs": 996,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "part means in a moment."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207736,
    "dDurationMs": 2091,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the basic takeaway of this study,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209827,
    "dDurationMs": 1073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I should mention that"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210900,
    "dDurationMs": 2863,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first author of the\nstudy is Palliyaguru,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213763,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PALLIYAGURU, guru,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218734,
    "dDurationMs": 1583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Palliyaguru, et al."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222770,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The basic finding of the\nstudy is that in humans,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225960,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "higher blood glucose is\nassociated with mortality."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231402,
    "dDurationMs": 2898,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in fact, if you look at blood glucose,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234300,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "resting blood glucose across the lifespan,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236610,
    "dDurationMs": 1477,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you find is as people age,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238087,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "resting blood glucose goes up."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240850,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this is very interesting,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242110,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because for a long time it was thought"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244330,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that metabolism actually\ngoes down as we age."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246950,
    "dDurationMs": 1473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to some extent, that's true,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248423,
    "dDurationMs": 2217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the reductions in metabolism"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250640,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are not nearly as robust\nas we once thought"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253000,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they were across the lifespan."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255080,
    "dDurationMs": 2524,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, unless there's something done"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257604,
    "dDurationMs": 3126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to mitigate the increase\nin blood glucose associated"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260730,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the aging,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261870,
    "dDurationMs": 2439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost everybody experiences a gradual,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264309,
    "dDurationMs": 3971,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but regular increase in\nresting blood glucose"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268280,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that predicts mortality."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270370,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the title, as I mentioned,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271730,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is \"Fasting Blood Glucose\nas a Predictor of Mortality:"
