  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170017,
    "dDurationMs": 2943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what you're going to do tomorrow."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172960,
    "dDurationMs": 1596,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there is a perfect diet for you."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174556,
    "dDurationMs": 1344,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And today, I'm going to arm you"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175900,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the mechanisms and understanding"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178170,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will allow you to define what"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179620,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that perfect diet is"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181020,
    "dDurationMs": 2708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and will allow you to eat on a schedule"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183728,
    "dDurationMs": 2532,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to eat the things that are going"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186260,
    "dDurationMs": 1381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to best serve your goals."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187641,
    "dDurationMs": 3759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's talk about eating\nand what happens when you eat,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191400,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and let's talk about\nfasting, or not eating,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194380,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what happens when you fast."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196059,
    "dDurationMs": 2537,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did an entire episode on eating"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198596,
    "dDurationMs": 3024,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and metabolism, and\nhormones and other factors"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201620,
    "dDurationMs": 1578,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that impact appetite."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203198,
    "dDurationMs": 2472,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We don't have time to go\ninto all those details now,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1205670,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "although you're welcome to\nlisten to that episode as well,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209071,
    "dDurationMs": 3973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but we can briefly describe\nthe overall conditions"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213044,
    "dDurationMs": 2325,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are set in the body when we eat"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215369,
    "dDurationMs": 2456,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when we don't eat."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217825,
    "dDurationMs": 2673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The key word here is conditions."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220498,
    "dDurationMs": 3936,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I can emphasize anything\ntoday, it's that what you eat"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224434,
    "dDurationMs": 4501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when you eat it set\nconditions in your body,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1228935,
    "dDurationMs": 2825,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those conditions can\nbe very good for you,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231760,
    "dDurationMs": 3435,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or very bad for you,\ndepending on when you eat."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235195,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, when you eat is as\nimportant as what you eat."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241349,
    "dDurationMs": 1901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll repeat that, when you eat"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1243250,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is as important as what you eat,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244830,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least as it relates\nto health parameters,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247100,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in particular, liver\nhealth and mental health."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250380,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some simple rules about eating."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251920,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First of all, when you eat,\ntypically your blood glucose,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256550,
    "dDurationMs": 1914,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your blood sugar, will go up."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258464,
    "dDurationMs": 2846,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also, insulin levels will go up."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261310,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Insulin is a hormone that's involved"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263010,
    "dDurationMs": 2944,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in mobilizing glucose\nfrom the bloodstream."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265954,
    "dDurationMs": 3716,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much your glucose and insulin go up"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269670,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depends on what you eat\nand how much you eat."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272060,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In general, simple sugars,\nincluding fructose from fruit,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277890,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also sucrose and glucose,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1279490,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and simple sugars will raise your insulin"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282450,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and blood glucose more\nthan complex carbohydrates."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286320,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things like grains, and breads,\nand pastas, and so forth,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288660,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and grains, and breads, and\npastas, and so forth will raise"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291620,
    "dDurationMs": 2406,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your blood glucose more\nthan fibrous carbohydrates,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294026,
    "dDurationMs": 3617,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like lettuce, and broccoli,\nand things of that sort."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297643,
    "dDurationMs": 2987,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Protein has a somewhat moderate"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300630,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or modest impact on insulin and glucose,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303200,
    "dDurationMs": 1831,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and fat has the lowest impact"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305031,
    "dDurationMs": 3338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on raising your blood\nglucose and blood insulin."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308369,
    "dDurationMs": 4271,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what you eat will\nimpact how steep a rise"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312640,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in blood glucose and insulin takes place."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1315480,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are a number of factors"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317300,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are related to your individual health"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1319240,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will also dictate how steep"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320540,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how high that rise in\nglucose and insulin will be."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324570,
    "dDurationMs": 867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the time being, I'm leaving"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325437,
    "dDurationMs": 2943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out people who have type one diabetes."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1328380,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are people that don't\nmanufacture their own insulin,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331020,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and type two diabetes is\nessentially insulin insensitivity,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336910,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lack of sensitivity to insulin,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1338560,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which leads to high blood glucose."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340880,
    "dDurationMs": 1291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, when you eat,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1342171,
    "dDurationMs": 2639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "blood glucose goes up\nand when you don't eat,"
