    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350773,
    "dDurationMs": 2887,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your blood glucose and insulin will be."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353660,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the higher, things like\nGLP1, glucagon-like peptide 1,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360053,
    "dDurationMs": 3727,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "glucagon being a hormone\nthat's also secreted"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363780,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you are in a fasted state\nor a low blood glucose state."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369300,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's involved in mobilizing\nvarious energy sources"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373210,
    "dDurationMs": 3352,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the body, including fat\nthrough what we call lipolysis,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376562,
    "dDurationMs": 1998,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also using carbohydrates,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1378560,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and potentially even using\nmuscle as a source of energy."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381280,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, that's kind of a fire hose"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385250,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of information about what happens"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387170,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you eat and don't eat,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388130,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but just think of it this way, blood sugar"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390260,
    "dDurationMs": 1368,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and insulin go up when you eat,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391628,
    "dDurationMs": 1722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they go down when you don't eat,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393350,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and other hormones go\nup when you don't eat."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396210,
    "dDurationMs": 2849,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are hormones associated\nwith the fasted state,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399059,
    "dDurationMs": 1549,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there are hormones associated"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400608,
    "dDurationMs": 4048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the eating and\nhaving just eaten state."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1404656,
    "dDurationMs": 2434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the most important thing"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407090,
    "dDurationMs": 4102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to understand is that,\nlike everything in biology,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411192,
    "dDurationMs": 3168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is a process that takes time."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414360,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So insulin and glucose go up when we eat,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1417237,
    "dDurationMs": 1583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it takes some period of time"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418820,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for them to go down,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420020,
    "dDurationMs": 1411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if we stop eating,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421431,
    "dDurationMs": 2719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they will remain up for\nsome period of time,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424150,
    "dDurationMs": 2683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then go back down, it takes time."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426833,
    "dDurationMs": 1817,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is very important,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428650,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because if you look at\nthe scientific literature"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431140,
    "dDurationMs": 3414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on fasting, on time-restricted feeding,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1434554,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's absolutely clear\nthat the health benefits,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438096,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not just the weight loss benefits,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1440430,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that the health benefits"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1441940,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from time-restricted feeding,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1443130,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "occur because certain conditions"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445620,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are met in the brain and body\nfor a certain amount of time."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450400,
    "dDurationMs": 1662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that gives us an anchor"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452062,
    "dDurationMs": 3018,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from which to view what eating"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1455080,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is in terms of how it sets\nconditions in the body over time."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1459640,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if that sounds overly\nanalytic, I promise you,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462940,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is the simplest"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464110,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and best way to think\nabout any eating schedule"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466920,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or any eating plan."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468530,
    "dDurationMs": 2642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think it's fair to say\nthat in the field of nutrition,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471172,
    "dDurationMs": 2841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are a few landmark\nstudies that serve"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474013,
    "dDurationMs": 3637,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as really strong anchors for\nbuilding our understanding"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477650,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what to eat and what not to eat"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479717,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when to eat, depending on our goals."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1482350,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Gardner study that I mentioned earlier"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1484360,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is one such study,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486100,
    "dDurationMs": 3014,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in that it says if your\ngoal is weight loss,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489114,
    "dDurationMs": 4376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it really does not matter\nwhat foods you consume,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1493490,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "provided that you consume a\nsub-maintenance, caloric diet."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497920,
    "dDurationMs": 1745,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, I want to emphasize again,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499665,
    "dDurationMs": 4565,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sets aside issues of adherence,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504230,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning how easy or hard it\nis to adhere to a given diet."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1507680,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people find it much easier"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1509160,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to follow a high fat,\nlow carbohydrate diet."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511240,
    "dDurationMs": 944,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people fall follow"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512184,
    "dDurationMs": 2026,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a different diet because it's much easier"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1514210,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for them to follow."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1515600,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And some people are concerned"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1516930,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with mental performance\nand athletic performance."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1519010,
    "dDurationMs": 2683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that study doesn't\nsay there's a best diet,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521693,
    "dDurationMs": 2173,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what it says is that what you consume"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1523866,
    "dDurationMs": 4774,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is less important than the\namount of food that you consume,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528640,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least for sake of weight loss,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1531000,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not necessarily for sake of health."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1533670,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the study that I'm going"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1535560,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to refer to next is what I would consider"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538210,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the second major pillar\nof nutritional studies."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1541050,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a truly landmark study"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542460,
    "dDurationMs": 3418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was carried out by Satchin Panda,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545878,
    "dDurationMs": 2822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who is a professor at the Salk Institute"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548700,
    "dDurationMs": 1243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Biological Studies in San Diego,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549943,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an absolutely phenomenal institution,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552910,
    "dDurationMs": 2059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and an absolutely phenomenal researcher."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554969,
    "dDurationMs": 2001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've known Satchin for a number of years,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556970,
    "dDurationMs": 3198,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I want to emphasize\nthat the current literature"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560168,
    "dDurationMs": 2022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on intermittent fasting"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562190,
    "dDurationMs": 1517,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and time restricted feeding can largely"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563707,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be attributed to Satchin"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1566196,
    "dDurationMs": 2014,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the work that he's done."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568210,
    "dDurationMs": 2375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are others involved too, of course."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1570585,
    "dDurationMs": 2175,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course, time-restricted feeding"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1572760,
    "dDurationMs": 3027,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and fasting has a rich history\nthat goes back many hundreds,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1575787,
    "dDurationMs": 2034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if not thousands of years\nin different cultures"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1577821,
    "dDurationMs": 1529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and religions,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1579350,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the science of time-restricted\nfeeding can really mainly"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582690,
    "dDurationMs": 2616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be attributed to the incredible\nwork that Satchin has done."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1585306,
    "dDurationMs": 4294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm grateful to consider\nhim a friend and a colleague,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1589600,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we consulted at length in\nanticipation of this episode."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1592550,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also hope to have him on\nas a guest in the future."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1595200,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The landmark paper that\ncame from Satchin's lab"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1597810,
    "dDurationMs": 1353,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was published in 2012."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1599163,
    "dDurationMs": 2864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was a paper in\nmice that set the basis"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1602027,
    "dDurationMs": 2983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for studies in humans that came later."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605010,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the title of this paper\nis time-restricted feeding"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608010,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without reducing caloric intake,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1610420,
    "dDurationMs": 3642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prevents metabolic diseases\nin mice fed a high fat diet."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614062,
    "dDurationMs": 2458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the title tells us a lot."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616520,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It says that what's varied in this study"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619350,
    "dDurationMs": 3373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not what these mice ate,\nit was when they ate it."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622723,
    "dDurationMs": 3177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there were essentially four conditions"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1625900,
    "dDurationMs": 3193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this study and the results\nare absolutely remarkable."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629093,
    "dDurationMs": 2731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm going to walk you\nthrough the major results."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1631824,
    "dDurationMs": 3397,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What they did is they gave mice access"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635221,
    "dDurationMs": 1734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to different types of food."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1636955,
    "dDurationMs": 1915,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were four groups,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1638870,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one group of mice had access\nto just a normal mouse diet."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643490,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It would not be a diet that\nyou'd be very interested in."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645284,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I confess I've actually tasted mouse chow."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647334,
    "dDurationMs": 2356,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you work with mice at\nall, you just have to do it."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649690,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At least once it doesn't taste very good,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651510,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it tastes like a very bland\nGraham cracker cookie."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1653660,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I confessed that. I only\nhad the tiniest little bit,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655280,
    "dDurationMs": 1261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but mice like that stuff."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1656541,
    "dDurationMs": 2859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you allow them to eat that stuff,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1659400,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what's called ad libitum\nwhenever they want,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1661580,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you just keep it in their\nfood. 24 hours a day,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1664020,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they will eat sometimes,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665240,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they won't eat it at\nother times, or in this case,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668870,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they also had a condition where\nthey gave them mouse chow in"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671670,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a time restricted way,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672880,
    "dDurationMs": 2951,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just for a certain\nnumber of hours each day,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675831,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but about eight hours, or they\ngave them a high-fat diet."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1681410,
    "dDurationMs": 910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was a separate group,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682320,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "got a high-fat diet at\nany time they wanted."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1684850,
    "dDurationMs": 1884,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this was kind of the\ncarnival for mice because mice"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686734,
    "dDurationMs": 2956,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really like high fat,\nhighly palatable foods."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1689690,
    "dDurationMs": 2259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so they got a lot of\ngoodies and high-fat in their"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1691949,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "food."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692950,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then there was a fourth\ngroup that had access to the"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695530,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "high fat diet as much\nas they wanted to eat,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1697950,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but only during a restricted\ntime period of each 24 hour"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701870,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cycle, now mice are nocturnal."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703570,
    "dDurationMs": 1853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Humans are what we call diurnal, actually,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705423,
    "dDurationMs": 2947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're not really diurnal\nwe're crepuscular,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1708370,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means that we're most\nactive in the morning and in the"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1710870,
    "dDurationMs": 3452,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evening, not so much in the\nafternoon, but nonetheless,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1714322,
    "dDurationMs": 4888,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything I'm going to tell\nyou is true also for humans."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1719210,
    "dDurationMs": 1414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we know this now from human studies,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1720624,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of the most important\nthings to take away from this"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1722783,
    "dDurationMs": 3905,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "study was that mice that ate\na highly palatable high-fat"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
