    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3089432,
    "dDurationMs": 3888,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but does not set you up to be\nreally out of sync with the"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3093320,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "social rhythms in most cultures."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3095813,
    "dDurationMs": 3857,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you think about it from the\nperspective of say a noon to"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3099670,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eight feeding window,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3101590,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you'll find is that\nyou're able to eat lunch with"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3104660,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "others."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3105770,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you like, or by yourself,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3107030,
    "dDurationMs": 2696,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you will be able to eat\ndinner at a reasonable hour,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3109726,
    "dDurationMs": 2185,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least in most countries,\nin most cultures,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3111911,
    "dDurationMs": 4877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eating dinner somewhere\nbetween 6:30 and 7:00 PM is"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3116788,
    "dDurationMs": 1155,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "typical."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3119150,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you say a feeding\nwindow, that goes until eight."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3121370,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That doesn't mean sitting\ndown to dinner at eight."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3123970,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means your last bite of\nfood or ingestion of any liquid"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3126770,
    "dDurationMs": 2329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "calories was at 8:00 PM."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3129099,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Assuming that you go to bed\nsomewhere between 10:00 PM and"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3132620,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1:00 AM that allows this tapering off,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3134950,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or this transition from\nfeeding to a fasted state,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3138440,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and still allows you to capitalize\non the special period of"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3142090,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fasting that is sleep-related fasting."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3144920,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And again,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3145753,
    "dDurationMs": 1637,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to emphasize that the\nfasting that occurs during"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3147390,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sleep is vital and eating too\nclose to sleep will disrupt"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3150227,
    "dDurationMs": 2988,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that fasting related sleep."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3153215,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3154048,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are a number of caveats\nand details related to this,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3156541,
    "dDurationMs": 4158,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's an important caveat\nin detail related to people"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3160699,
    "dDurationMs": 4048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are specifically\ninterested in increasing or"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3164747,
    "dDurationMs": 1551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maintaining muscle mass."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3166298,
    "dDurationMs": 4919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So first let's talk about food\nvolume and food type and how"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3171217,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that relates to whether or not\nyou quickly or slowly enter a"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3176551,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fasted state."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3178230,
    "dDurationMs": 2826,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because clearly when we\ntalk about a feeding window,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3181056,
    "dDurationMs": 2754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that feeding window could\ninclude any number of different"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3183810,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "foods, it could involve\ncake and ice cream, pizza,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3186020,
    "dDurationMs": 3222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hamburgers, plants, fruit, whatever it is,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3189242,
    "dDurationMs": 3955,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it could involve just fats\nor just proteins, et cetera."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3193197,
    "dDurationMs": 3332,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are at least three\nfactors that are going to govern"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3196529,
    "dDurationMs": 4535,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how quickly you transition\nfrom ingesting food to a fasted"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3201064,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "state, remember,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3202383,
    "dDurationMs": 4013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you ingest your last\nbite or sip of calories,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3206396,
    "dDurationMs": 2094,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's not when the fast begins."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3208490,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That might be when the fastening\nbegins on your watch or on"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3211133,
    "dDurationMs": 2117,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of these apps that\nI'll refer to later,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3213250,
    "dDurationMs": 2125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which can help you track your\nfasting and eating windows."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3215375,
    "dDurationMs": 3097,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's not when it actually\nbegins because your body is"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3218472,
    "dDurationMs": 1748,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still seeing food."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3220220,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're actually carrying\naround food inside of you,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3223150,
    "dDurationMs": 1663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though you're not\nputting into your mouth,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3224813,
    "dDurationMs": 3187,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're still eating in some sense."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3228000,
    "dDurationMs": 2979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it should be somewhat obvious\nthat very large meals are"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3230979,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to take longer to\ndigest than very small meals."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3233780,
    "dDurationMs": 4149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that will impact how slowly\nor quickly you migrate from a"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3237929,
    "dDurationMs": 3153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fed state to a fasted state."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3241082,
    "dDurationMs": 3697,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no way I can spell out\nwhat exact volume of food you"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3244779,
    "dDurationMs": 2901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should ingest based on the\nsize of your stomach and et"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3247680,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cetera, but you're all familiar\nwith being extremely full,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3251550,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very full, comfortably\nfull, somewhat full,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3255150,
    "dDurationMs": 2486,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or not feeling full and feeling hungry."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3257636,
    "dDurationMs": 3286,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So learning to gauge\nfood volume is important."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3260922,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also foods that include some\nfats or a lot of fats will tend"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3266240,
    "dDurationMs": 1779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to slow gastric emptying time."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3268019,
    "dDurationMs": 2991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And depending on the kind of fats,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3271010,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it could mean that a given\nmeal is digested within three"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3274370,
    "dDurationMs": 1047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hours versus five hours."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3275417,
    "dDurationMs": 3153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And more fats might be a large\nmeal with a lot of fats has"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3278570,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "been, can take five or six hours."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3279960,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A smaller meal with less fat\nis going to be digested more"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3282300,
    "dDurationMs": 3126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quickly consuming calories in\nliquid form is going to mean"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3285426,
    "dDurationMs": 2442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that gastric emptying time\nis going to be faster."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3287868,
    "dDurationMs": 1432,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then of course,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3289300,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's the glucose and\nthe insulin aspect to it,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3292010,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is that foods that lead\nto big steep rises in glucose"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3295051,
    "dDurationMs": 1868,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like pure sugars."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3296919,
    "dDurationMs": 2631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then your glucose will drop, however,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3299550,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if they're combined with fats,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3300860,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then it tends to be a more\ngradual rise in glucose and it's"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3303160,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more sustained, et cetera."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3304580,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fibrous foods will also create\na more long lasting sustained"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3307714,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "release in glucose."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3311027,
    "dDurationMs": 3203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The important thing here is\nto establish a feeding window"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3314230,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you can comfortably manage, okay?"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3317330,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meaning that on average,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3318830,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can obey a six hour\nfeeding window or an eight hour"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3322600,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "feeding window or a 10\nhour feeding window."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3324830,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then to place that feeding\nwindow in a social and life"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3329150,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "context that you can manage\non a regular basis, now,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3332680,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are two key points that\nhave been gleaned from the"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3335330,
    "dDurationMs": 2956,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scientific data about this\nfeeding window and when to place"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3338286,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3339370,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is based on a\nreally important experiment"
