  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4400514,
    "dDurationMs": 1211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things that we can take."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4401725,
    "dDurationMs": 905,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I'd like to discuss those briefly."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4402630,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So throughout this episode,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4404380,
    "dDurationMs": 3251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've more or less been alluding\nto the fact that when you"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4407631,
    "dDurationMs": 3223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eat, there's some period of\ntime afterwards in which you're"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4410854,
    "dDurationMs": 1926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually still eating,"
