    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4468800,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by now with everything\nthat we've laid out,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4471340,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that should be\nintuitive to understand."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4473861,
    "dDurationMs": 3049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's a fun and exciting\nconcept related to this,"
