    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4519038,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4519871,
    "dDurationMs": 4179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can accelerate that\nconsiderably by taking a 20 or 30"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4524050,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "minute just light walk, it\ndoesn't have to be speed walking."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4527300,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It certainly doesn't have to be jogging,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4528490,
    "dDurationMs": 2388,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but just walking outside or moving around."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4530878,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So glucose clearing is an\nimportant aspect of the transition"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4536127,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the fed state to the fasted state."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4538377,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just a light walk can\nallow you to do that, now,"
