    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The study was carried out in\nhumans and is entitled effects"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6142750,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of eight hour time restricted\nfeeding on body weight and"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6145590,
    "dDurationMs": 4063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "metabolic disease, risk factors\nin obese adults, excuse me."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6149653,
    "dDurationMs": 3047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this study essentially showed,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6152700,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll just read the conclusions\nthat an eight hour time"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6156560,
    "dDurationMs": 3302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "restricted feeding produces a\nmild caloric restriction and"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6159862,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "weight loss without calorie\ncounting, so that's key, right?"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6165070,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These people aren't calorie\ncounting somehow just by"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6167140,
    "dDurationMs": 1873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "adhering to an eight hour window."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6169013,
    "dDurationMs": 4849,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are taking in fewer\ncalories than they're burning off"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6173862,
    "dDurationMs": 4038,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and clinically it reduced blood pressure."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6177900,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I mentioned the study,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6178880,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not because there aren't many\nothers involving the eight"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6181070,
    "dDurationMs": 1365,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hour feeding window also in humans,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6182435,
    "dDurationMs": 3201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but because the eight hour\nfeeding window has been tested in"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6185636,
    "dDurationMs": 2224,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "obese adults and non obese adults."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6187860,
    "dDurationMs": 2041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are even a\nfew studies in children."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6189901,
    "dDurationMs": 3429,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this eight hour window seems\nto be a really good rule of"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6193330,
    "dDurationMs": 3232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thumb and a kind of anchor\naround which we can each think"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6196562,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about incorporating\ntime restricted feeding."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6199940,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are of course,\nother patterns of feeding."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6202210,
    "dDurationMs": 4751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while some people have\nengaged in longer fasts of 24"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6206961,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hours, 36 hours or more\nalternate day fasting,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6213160,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning eating one day,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6215240,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not eating the next day or in\nsome cases eating one day and"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6218020,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eating very few calories,\n500 or 600 calories"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6220690,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the next day has been tested."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6223450,
    "dDurationMs": 2024,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few studies have also\nlooked at eating a sort of"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6225474,
    "dDurationMs": 2976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maintenance level of\ncalories for five days,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6228450,
    "dDurationMs": 3111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then taking two days\nand fast clear through,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6231561,
    "dDurationMs": 4349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or eating very few calories,\nyou know, 300 or 500 calories."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6235910,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6236743,
    "dDurationMs": 3347,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a sort of a community\nonline of people that are"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6240090,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exploring longer,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6240923,
    "dDurationMs": 2276,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fast for sake of trying to\noffset dementia or reverse"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6243199,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "effects of dementia, thus\nfar, at least in my awareness,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6248314,
    "dDurationMs": 4356,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there isn't any quality clinical\npeer reviewed study on that"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6252670,
    "dDurationMs": 3157,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yet for sake of dementia,\nalthough I await those studies,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6255827,
    "dDurationMs": 1743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if anyone's aware of them,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6257570,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "please send me a link in the comments."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6259110,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But alternate day fasting has\ngotten the so-called safe bill"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6264030,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of health."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6264863,
    "dDurationMs": 1678,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has been written up meaning\nthat people didn't suffer"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6266541,
    "dDurationMs": 3852,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bone loss, they didn't suffer\nany major detrimental effects."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6270393,
    "dDurationMs": 4989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does seem that it can create\nsignificant weight loss and"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6275382,
    "dDurationMs": 3846,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can help with obese individuals\nthat it can reduce resting"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6279228,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "blood glucose,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6280228,
    "dDurationMs": 3103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and every other day fasting\nin many cases can produce more"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6283331,
    "dDurationMs": 4124,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rapid effects on weight loss\nand reductions in blood glucose"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6287455,
    "dDurationMs": 2395,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than time restricted feeding, however,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6289850,
    "dDurationMs": 4494,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every other day type fasting\nfor most people is not going to"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6294344,
    "dDurationMs": 1796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be feasible."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6296140,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're just not going to be\nable to do that for a long"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6297960,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "period of time."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6298793,
    "dDurationMs": 1689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what hasn't really been\ndone is the follow-up to see"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6300482,
    "dDurationMs": 2743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether or not people who do\nevery other day fasting or five"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6303225,
    "dDurationMs": 2925,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "days of eating followed\nby two days of fasting,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6306150,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether or not that leads\nto a rebound in weight gain,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6308790,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether or not that leads to\na rebound in blood glucose,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6310940,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "et cetera."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6311773,
    "dDurationMs": 3027,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for now the eight hour feeding\nwindow and time restricted"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6314800,
    "dDurationMs": 3915,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "feeding seems to be the most tested,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6318715,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "supported in animal studies and\nin human studies and the one"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6322594,
    "dDurationMs": 3076,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around which I think\nmost people should orient"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6325670,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if they're considering getting\ninto time-restricted feeding,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6328270,
    "dDurationMs": 3264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's also sort of hard to\nimagine how one could include a"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6331534,
    "dDurationMs": 4716,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "significant exercise schedule\nor work schedule on every"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6336250,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other day fasting."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6337120,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember, in any study, people\nare often being compensated,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6339980,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or at least are incentivized\nin some way to adhere to the"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6343346,
    "dDurationMs": 1002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "study."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6344348,
    "dDurationMs": 2562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is one of the major issues\nthat I have with any study"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6346910,
    "dDurationMs": 2707,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that says that three or four\ndifferent diets are essentially"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6349617,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equal in terms of their\nability to produce weight loss."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6353350,
    "dDurationMs": 3675,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adherence is very different\nin the outside world where you"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6357025,
    "dDurationMs": 2375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't have a researcher\nmonitoring you where you're not"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6359400,
    "dDurationMs": 1183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "logging all your food."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6360583,
    "dDurationMs": 1931,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most people don't do that consistently."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6362514,
    "dDurationMs": 2524,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we can take a little bit\nof a neuroscience perspective"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6365038,
    "dDurationMs": 2689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on this to try and arrive\nat what the best kind of"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6367727,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "organization of an eating plan,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6370160,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or if we wanted to call it a diet,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6371640,
    "dDurationMs": 2425,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we could would be for you."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6374065,
    "dDurationMs": 3098,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many people find it easier\nto just not eat for certain"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6377163,
    "dDurationMs": 4487,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "periods of each 24 hour cycle\nthan to eat smaller portions,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6381650,
    "dDurationMs": 2677,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "portion control is very\nhard for some people,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6384327,
    "dDurationMs": 4243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for other people it's\nmanageable, but people like me."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6388570,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't eat half the croissant."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6390680,
    "dDurationMs": 2429,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think it's a real thing, it's not,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6393109,
    "dDurationMs": 2231,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not available to me, I should say."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6395340,
    "dDurationMs": 2256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, of course I could\neat just half a croissant,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6397596,
    "dDurationMs": 2174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I noticed that when\nI eat the croissant,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6399770,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they're so delicious\nthat it creates a rise in blood"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6402810,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "glucose a rise in the other\nhormones and chemicals that are"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6406760,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "associated with ingesting\ndelicious, highly palatable food."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6409763,
    "dDurationMs": 2848,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's actually a lot of work\nfor me to just eat half the"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6412611,
    "dDurationMs": 1397,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "croissant."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6414008,
    "dDurationMs": 4577,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's something that's much\nmore thoroughly satisfying"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6418585,
    "dDurationMs": 2105,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about eating the entire croissant."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6420690,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually there's something\nthat somewhat satisfying"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6423390,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about not eating the croissant at all."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6425140,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just knowing that later I\ncan eat the whole croissant."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6427430,
    "dDurationMs": 970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that's me."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6428400,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Other people find that they\ndon't have any trouble with"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6431380,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "portion control that for them\njust eating small bits of food"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6434850,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughout the day is what\nsets them in the right"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6436790,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "psychological and physical\nstate for sake of work,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6439440,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "et cetera."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6440273,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I mentioned work and\nmental focus because one of the"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6442193,
    "dDurationMs": 3405,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "aspects of fasting that have\ndrawn a lot of people to time"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6445598,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "restricted feeding and fasting\nis the clarity of mind that"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6449519,
    "dDurationMs": 1426,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people get."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6450945,
    "dDurationMs": 1955,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When first of all,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6452900,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't have to think about\nwhen they're going to eat"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
