    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time restricted feeding with\na sub caloric intake seems to"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6785640,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be at least to my mind,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6787260,
    "dDurationMs": 2788,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most scientifically\nsupported way to ensure that a"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6790048,
    "dDurationMs": 2898,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "significant portion of the\nweight that one loses is from"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6792946,
    "dDurationMs": 2604,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "body fat stores."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6795550,
    "dDurationMs": 3138,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any discussion about fasting\nwould be incomplete without a"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6798688,
    "dDurationMs": 3536,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "discussion about what does\nand does not break a fast."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6802224,
    "dDurationMs": 1616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6803840,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is no black and white\nanswer to that question,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6807060,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you should immediately\nunderstand why it's because"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6810855,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eating and not eating are not\nequivalent to fed and fasted."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6816690,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It depends on when you ate\nhow much you ate and where you"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6822380,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are in your circadian cycle."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6824810,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can actually arrive at a\nsimple answer to whether or not"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6827360,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something breaks the fast or not."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6829180,
    "dDurationMs": 1922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the technical way to go\nabout this would be to wear a"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6831102,
    "dDurationMs": 3415,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "continuous glucose monitor\nand to ingest little bits of"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6834517,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "food, of different kinds\nor large amounts of food,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6837250,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of different kinds and\nmeasure blood glucose,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6839850,
    "dDurationMs": 2886,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because ultimately blood glucose\nis the readout of whether"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6842736,
    "dDurationMs": 2061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or not your system is in\na fed or fasted state."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6844797,
    "dDurationMs": 2203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are other parameters too, of course,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6847000,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's the dominant one"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6849910,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in so far as the scientific\nliterature says drinking water"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6855442,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will not break your fast\ndrinking tea will not break your"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6860720,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fast drinking coffee,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6862520,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "provided it as black coffee\nwill not break your fast"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6866940,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ingesting caffeine in pill\nform will not break your fast."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6870850,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are other things\nthat won't break your fast."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6872670,
    "dDurationMs": 999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For instance,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6873669,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eating one peanut when deep in\na fasted state will not break"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6877297,
    "dDurationMs": 3543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your fast, eating a whole\nhandful of peanuts might not even"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6880840,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "break your fast if you are\nin a very low glucose state."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6884750,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6885583,
    "dDurationMs": 2427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you just finished a meal\nthat included carbohydrates,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6888010,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it was a very large meal\nof any kind an hour ago, yes,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6891638,
    "dDurationMs": 4202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "indeed, eating one peanut\ncould break your fast."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6895840,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's all contextual, that's"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6898160,
    "dDurationMs": 1219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what's really important to understand,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6899379,
    "dDurationMs": 2641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unless you're going to wear\na continuous glucose monitor."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6902020,
    "dDurationMs": 2876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And unless you are going to\nwear a continuous glucose"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6904896,
    "dDurationMs": 4494,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "monitor and set an absolute\nnumerical threshold for what it"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6909390,
    "dDurationMs": 1269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to break your fast."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6910659,
    "dDurationMs": 3375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there are some simple\nrules that we can follow."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6914034,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First of all, anything that\ninvolves sugar in particular,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6919550,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simple sugars can\npotentially break your fast."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6921860,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's actually a study on this,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6923440,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which shows that if\npeople ingest even one,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6927027,
    "dDurationMs": 4283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one gram of sugar post dinner,"
