    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7434540,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "acidity, that if they're feeling\nkind of shaky and not well,"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7436980,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they put some lemon juice\ninto water and drink that it"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7439860,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drops their blood glucose further."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7441404,
    "dDurationMs": 3706,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's a common practice\nnowadays that's discussed on"
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7445110,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the internet of waking up\ndrinking some water with some lime"
