    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7481440,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but what will actually\nremedy that is some salt."
    } ],
    "wpWinPosId": 1
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7484560,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I know a number of people\nthat have incorporated this"
